# Normalise line endings so the whole tree stops showing as modified.
#
# The repo has LF in its committed blobs while the working tree is CRLF, and
# with core.autocrlf unset git reported every source file as changed. That hid
# real edits and made diffs unreadable.
#
# After adding this file, run once to re-normalise the index:
#   git add --renormalize .
#   git commit -m "Normalise line endings"
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git shouldn't touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary